{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall not touch their carcasses.</b> Our Sages explained — for the festival, that a person is obligated to purify himself for the festival. One might conclude they are warned all year round — therefore Scripture says, ״Speak to the priests, etc.״ (Leviticus 21). And since corpse-impurity is more severe — the priests are warned but Israelites are not — carcass-impurity, which is lighter — all the more so."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:00.935380144Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}